Exercise 2: Implementing Dependency Injection
Update the BookService.java setter method:
public void setRepository(BookRepository repository) {
    this.repository = repository;
}


Update applicationContext.xml to inject the repository:
<bean id="bookRepository" class="com.library.repository.BookRepository"/>

<bean id="bookService" class="com.library.service.BookService">
    <property name="repository" ref="bookRepository"/>
</bean>


Run LibraryManagementApplication.java.
Expected output:
Book Service is working
Book Repository is working
